1447 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Dexterity Score increases by 1\056\nDwarven Toughness\056 As sworn protectors of nature\054 you may cast Speak With Animals once per day\056 Starting at 5th level\054 you may also cast Conjure Animals once per day\056 Your spellcasting ability for these spells is Charisma\056 You also gain expertise in the Nature skill\054 if you do not already have it\056\n)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1448 0 R
     /Pg 1116 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
