1451 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Isolated and chaotic\054 Marsh Dwarves exist with a single\055minded hatred for civilization and every city built by civilized hands\056 Knowing their mountain kin shun them\054 they avoid the high peaks entirely\054 lingering in damp\054 rot\055choked swamps\056 Their skin displays strange hues\054 varying from pale blueish tints to sickly green shades\056 Unkempt facial hair hangs down over their short frames\054 hosting insects and parasites that feed on the mold trapped within the thick mats\056 Deep orange eyes cut through the gloom of the bog\054 paired with long\054 yellowed fingernails that serve as practical tools in the wilderness\056\n\nTheir burning malice toward organized settlements leaves them isolated\054 driving them to form uneasy alliances with goblins\054 orcs\054 and other outcasts\056 Rumors of strange powers follow them through the wetlands\054 inspiring folk tales that make even hardened mountain dwarves uneasy\056 Because no outside scholar or elder knows the origin of these abilities\054 a cloud of dread surrounds their lineage\056 Marsh Dwarves live out their lives far from the order of the clans\054 fueled by spite and content to see the works of other humanoids crumble into decay\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1452 0 R
     /Pg 1116 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1452 0 obj
  << /K [ 1451 0 R ]
     /P 1455 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 1116 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1453 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Heavy Trudging\056 Years of trudging through thick marshlands has given you more strength in your legs than other Dwarves\056 Your base movement speed is now 30ft instead of 25ft\056\nGhostly Whispers\056 Marsh Dwarves are able to communicate in unique ways\056 You learn the message cantrip\056 Your spellcasting ability is Charisma for this spell\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1454 0 R
     /Pg 1116 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

