1460 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Preferring to make their homes in high mountain ranges\054 these Dwarves are rarely seen outside of Highpeak\056 Although other mountain ranges exist in Pliara\054 Highpeak is the tallest\056 The continent is large enough that the Range Dwarves can live in their carved out\054 mountainside homes and caves with little\055to\055no interaction with the Highpeak Officials or travelers to Highpeak City\056\n\nA Range Dwarf is not immediately distinguishable from a Hill Dwarf upon first glance\073 however\054 there are some notable differences\056 A Range Dwarf\047s facial hair is almost always extremely curly and either a brown or red color\056 A Range Dwarf also stands just a hair taller than their brethren\054 averaging around 3\0565 feet\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1461 0 R
     /Pg 1432 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

