1470 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Constitution Score increases by 2\nAge\056 Dwarves do not reach adulthood until around ago 50\054 living to around 350 years\056\nAlignment\056 Most dwarves are lawful\054 believing firmly in the benefits of a well\055ordered society\056 They tend toward good as well\054 with a strong sense of fair play and a belief that everyone deserves to share in the benefits of a just order\056 Marsh Dwarves tend to be the exception to this rule\054 leaning more towards a chaotic and evil living\nSize\056 Most Dwarves stand between 4 and 5 feet tall and average about 150 pounds\056 Your size is Medium\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 25 feet\056\nDarkvision\056You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You can\047t discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nDwarven Resilience\056 You have advantage on saving throws against poison\054 and you have resistance against poison damage\056\nDwarven Combat Training\056 You have proficiency with the battleaxe\054 handaxe\054 light hammer\054 and warhammer\056\nTool Proficiency\072 You gain proficiency with the artisan\047s tools of your choice\072 smith\047s tools\054 brewer\047s supplies\054 or mason\047s tools\056\nStonecunning\056 Whenever you make an Intelligence \050History\051 check related to the origin of stonework\054 you are considered proficient in the History skill and add double your proficiency bonus to the check\054 instead of your normal proficiency bonus\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read\054 and write Common and Dwarvish\056 Dwarvish is full of hard consonants and guttural sounds\054 and those characteristics spill over into whatever other language a dwarf might speak\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1471 0 R
     /Pg 1434 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

